cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using this file."
type: software

title: "SO(5) Witt Basis: Explicit Constructions and Symbolic Verification"

authors:
  - family-names: "Bairakji"
    given-names: "Serine"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Serine-325/SO5-Witt-Basis"

url: "https://so5-witt-basis.onrender.com"

abstract: >-
  Python implementations of explicit Witt basis constructions
  for elliptic maximal tori in split SO(5).
  The software covers sums of two quadratic extensions,
  biquadratic extensions, and quartic extensions.
  It includes admissibility checks, symbolic Gram-matrix
  verification, automated tests, and an interactive
  Streamlit application.
